GET {{baseUrl}}/large

::: query
size = 15000000

::: post
test("above the old 10 MB limit", () => {
  expect(res.status).toBe(200);
  expect(res.size).toBeGreaterThan(14900000);
});

::: docs
A 15 MB body, bigger than the 10 MB limit that used to make this fail (#35). The default limit is now 20 MB, and Settings, Requests can raise it.
